<title>HONG KONG: New World in HK$2.62 bln placement-source.</title>
<headline>New World in HK$2.62 bln placement-source.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New World Development Co Ltd was placing 70 million shares at HK$37.40 each to raise HK$2.62 billion gross, a source close to the placing agents said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
